  "body": "G.J. Gardner Homes House and Land Package featuring a Custom design.\r\n\r\nThis thoughtful design offers everything you want for comfortable, easy living with views of the sea and city lights. Boasting two lounges and a generous kitchen and scullery with an outdoor area just off the dining room. Four bedrooms, an ensuite and walk-in robe in the primary, plus a full bath and powder room for guests. This home also features two additional decked areas providing you with multiple options for your morning cuppa. Come see why this plan is right for your family.\r\n\r\nYour plan, our plans, or we can design from scratch. For more information visit our website http://www.gjgardner.co.nz\r\nMORE NEW ZEALANDERS TRUST G.J. GARDNER TO BUILD THEIR HOMES THAN ANY OTHER BUILDER.\r\n\r\nIf you’re thinking about building, make Home Prep the first step in your journey. It’s our essential step-by-step guide to the building process. Full of independent advice and handy information to help you have a great building experience. Get your free copy from gjgardner.co.nz today.\r\n\r\n*Price is an indication only and includes land. Some conditions may apply. Image is artist’s impression only.\r\n\r\nCopyright G.J. Gardner Homes",
